(5173039, 752864, 102278, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and PP.  My pick for the Blue. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and PP.  My pick for the Blue. 10.', '2009-01-05 15:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173040, 753064, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours!  Great composition. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful colours!  Great composition. 9.', '2009-01-05 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173044, 753095, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph. Great texture. Love it! 9.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph. Great texture. Love it! 9.', '2009-01-05 15:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173045, 753099, 102278, '<td valign="top">Great composition. 9.</td>', 'Great composition. 9.', '2009-01-05 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173068, 753064, 79121, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite!</td>', 'This one is my favorite!', '2009-01-05 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173077, 752878, 54446, '<td valign="top">Really unique and interesting.  Wish I was there!  (always a good sign for an image, when I lose myself in the image and ignore the technical factors.)  (10)</td>', 'Really unique and interesting.  Wish I was there!  (always a good sign for an image, when I lose myself in the image and ignore the technical factors.)  (10)', '2009-01-05 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173081, 752974, 54446, '<td valign="top">I hate the frame, but I love everything else.  (1))</td>', 'I hate the frame, but I love everything else.  (1))', '2009-01-05 16:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173087, 751375, 54446, '<td valign="top">Just technically superior to most.  This is a great photo.  A great closeup, as I see details I wouldn''t see with the naked eye.  Amazing and wonderful narrow DOF.  (10)</td>', 'Just technically superior to most.  This is a great photo.  A great closeup, as I see details I wouldn''t see with the naked eye.  Amazing and wonderful narrow DOF.  (10)', '2009-01-05 16:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173093, 753084, 54446, '<td valign="top">The symmetrical composition is perfect for this subject.  This is really a brilliant capture of the action.  One of the few, if possibly the only, image with sand in motion.  (I didn''t count the hour glass images.)   My favorite in this challenge, which included some outstanding images.  Hope to see this ribbon!  (10)</td>', 'The symmetrical composition is perfect for this subject.  This is really a brilliant capture of the action.  One of the few, if possibly the only, image with sand in motion.  (I didn''t count the hour glass images.)   My favorite in this challenge, which included some outstanding images.  Hope to see this ribbon!  (10)', '2009-01-05 16:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173101, 753196, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very, very good.  You have a great eye.  The direct sun reflection will always blow out the highlights.  The golden sand with the darkgrayblue water bands is exquisite.  (9)</td>', 'Very, very good.  You have a great eye.  The direct sun reflection will always blow out the highlights.  The golden sand with the darkgrayblue water bands is exquisite.  (9)', '2009-01-05 16:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173105, 753026, 54446, '<td valign="top">Love the shell smoothness and the sand granularity in this.  Good choice for b&amp;w presentation.  I hate the frame, but only counted off 1 point for your choice to reduce the viewable size of the image.  (9)</td>', 'Love the shell smoothness and the sand granularity in this.  Good choice for b&w presentation.  I hate the frame, but only counted off 1 point for your choice to reduce the viewable size of the image.  (9)', '2009-01-05 16:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173107, 753096, 61396, '<td valign="top">Smart composition depicting a dichotomy in multiple ways (Sea vs. Sky, Free vs. Grounded, Sand vs. Water, Far vs. Close, Blue vs. Orange to name the ones I could spot)</td>', 'Smart composition depicting a dichotomy in multiple ways (Sea vs. Sky, Free vs. Grounded, Sand vs. Water, Far vs. Close, Blue vs. Orange to name the ones I could spot)', '2009-01-05 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173109, 752871, 54446, '<td valign="top">This image created a dilemma for me.  I hate the dodged sky.  I do not like the black band top and bottom.  But, I love the subject and the sand dune.  Oh, if only you had made a few better presentation choices.  (9)</td>', 'This image created a dilemma for me.  I hate the dodged sky.  I do not like the black band top and bottom.  But, I love the subject and the sand dune.  Oh, if only you had made a few better presentation choices.  (9)', '2009-01-05 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173173, 753064, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I submitted a very, very similar shot of this exact spot last summer.  I like how you were able to keep the highlights under control where the sun comes in.  I had a bit of trouble with that in my submission :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=704130" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/704130.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/704130.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/704130.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Nicely done!  I submitted a very, very similar shot of this exact spot last summer.  I like how you were able to keep the highlights under control where the sun comes in.  I had a bit of trouble with that in my submission :) ', '2009-01-05 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173208, 752576, 55956, '<td valign="top">is a pity break a so beautiful hourglass... the only thing that don''t work are the white "spots" of the glass(evidently no a reflection).</td>', 'is a pity break a so beautiful hourglass... the only thing that don''t work are the white "spots" of the glass(evidently no a reflection).', '2009-01-05 17:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
