(5173801, 753106, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice curved lines, leading the eye around the photo.  Slight tilt to the horizon.  Hard to tell for sure but the DOF seems not to have infinity in focus.</td>', 'Nice curved lines, leading the eye around the photo.  Slight tilt to the horizon.  Hard to tell for sure but the DOF seems not to have infinity in focus.', '2009-01-05 22:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173802, 752793, 91496, '<td valign="top">Bold composition.  Colors palette of green/brown/black clash and distract a bit.  Focus seems a bit soft on the sand.</td>', 'Bold composition.  Colors palette of green/brown/black clash and distract a bit.  Focus seems a bit soft on the sand.', '2009-01-05 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173804, 751967, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The grain/noise/texture really adds to the grit of the sand.  Hand looks a little odd with the black finger tips.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The grain/noise/texture really adds to the grit of the sand.  Hand looks a little odd with the black finger tips.', '2009-01-05 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173826, 751908, 91496, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Overall I like it.  I wonder what it would look like with no medallian and the shell having the focus point.  Three subjects in a scene may be one too many (four if you count the sand).</td>', 'Hmmm.  Overall I like it.  I wonder what it would look like with no medallian and the shell having the focus point.  Three subjects in a scene may be one too many (four if you count the sand).', '2009-01-05 22:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173834, 751669, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the curves of the waves and of the figures.  Not sure the foreground blur or high noise add to the photo''s impact.</td>', 'Nice capture of the curves of the waves and of the figures.  Not sure the foreground blur or high noise add to the photo''s impact.', '2009-01-05 22:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173838, 753070, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice colors -- Like the umbrella.  Shallow DOF has completey obscurred the sand.  Would be better with the sand detail more visable in a sand challenge.</td>', 'Nice colors -- Like the umbrella.  Shallow DOF has completey obscurred the sand.  Would be better with the sand detail more visable in a sand challenge.', '2009-01-05 22:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173840, 753130, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool tilt, adds a sense of motion to the shot.  Nice sky.<br/>Hate these type of borders - sorry.</td>', 'Cool tilt, adds a sense of motion to the shot.  Nice sky.Hate these type of borders - sorry.', '2009-01-05 22:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173844, 752201, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great mood with the fog/mist.  The figures make a great composition.  Love the vignette.  The horizon has a big tilt.</td>', 'Great mood with the fog/mist.  The figures make a great composition.  Love the vignette.  The horizon has a big tilt.', '2009-01-05 22:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173849, 752677, 91496, '<td valign="top">A lot going on here.  Perhaps too much.  I like the diagonal and horizontal lines as they work well.  The runners are a bit tight to the crop.  Two on the people appear to be looking at you and one is hiding.  It makes for an odd mix of people.</td>', 'A lot going on here.  Perhaps too much.  I like the diagonal and horizontal lines as they work well.  The runners are a bit tight to the crop.  Two on the people appear to be looking at you and one is hiding.  It makes for an odd mix of people.', '2009-01-05 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173855, 751504, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice wave action making patterns in the water.  Love the leaf.  The duck looks a bit static, perhaps if his eye was less shadowed.</td>', 'Nice wave action making patterns in the water.  Love the leaf.  The duck looks a bit static, perhaps if his eye was less shadowed.', '2009-01-05 22:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173865, 752096, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  Perhaps a bit much going on with patterns of the quilt and the dog''s crazy hairdo.  Not sure I connect the hourglass to the dog.  Is the dog old?</td>', 'Interesting composition.  Perhaps a bit much going on with patterns of the quilt and the dog''s crazy hairdo.  Not sure I connect the hourglass to the dog.  Is the dog old?', '2009-01-05 22:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173871, 753075, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the highlighted treatment.  It brings out the rawness of nature, etc.  Crop might be a bit tight too the skull.</td>', 'I like the highlighted treatment.  It brings out the rawness of nature, etc.  Crop might be a bit tight too the skull.', '2009-01-05 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5173890, 752752, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I like how the hills and sky are placed.  Somehow the perpective and scale do not work for me, as it seems that the water is very far away, but the footsteps show that it is close by.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I like how the hills and sky are placed.  Somehow the perpective and scale do not work for me, as it seems that the water is very far away, but the footsteps show that it is close by.', '2009-01-05 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
