(5181355, 752251, 102428, '<td valign="top">it is different to see someone interpret sand in a way that you wouldn''t think. in my opinion it is nice to see people go out of the box and to see things that are not related to the beach or the obvious picture that comes into the mind when you think of sand. this picture however quite different is in my opinion a little boring to look at you should have done something different with the sand timer be creative!!!!!</td>', 'it is different to see someone interpret sand in a way that you wouldn''t think. in my opinion it is nice to see people go out of the box and to see things that are not related to the beach or the obvious picture that comes into the mind when you think of sand. this picture however quite different is in my opinion a little boring to look at you should have done something different with the sand timer be creative!!!!!', '2009-01-08 21:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181363, 752871, 58868, '<td valign="top">maybe have the shell more off center...still a great shot. great color.</td>', 'maybe have the shell more off center...still a great shot. great color.', '2009-01-08 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181365, 753032, 102428, '<td valign="top">i give you cheers for doing something different but still making it a interesting picture. when i looked at this picture it was different it is not the obvious thing when you think of sand and you see this but it is nice to see that you went out of the box but still in the process still made it interesting.</td>', 'i give you cheers for doing something different but still making it a interesting picture. when i looked at this picture it was different it is not the obvious thing when you think of sand and you see this but it is nice to see that you went out of the box but still in the process still made it interesting.', '2009-01-08 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181368, 751375, 58868, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, maybe the shell more off center showing more of the sand in a horizontal shot rather than a "portait" of just the shell.  I think would make for more of an interesting shot. 7</td>', 'I like the idea, maybe the shell more off center showing more of the sand in a horizontal shot rather than a "portait" of just the shell.  I think would make for more of an interesting shot. 7', '2009-01-08 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181378, 753174, 63503, '<td valign="top">It it wasn''t because it is winter time in Iceland I would bet this is a LARUS (with his famous 1.2 lens), unless it really is Larus forcing her to pretend she is not freezing. Great picture. I am not voting because I am in the race. I''d give it a 9 if I was voting (10 for her expression if I knew it is ice and snow in the background instead of ocean and waves). Of course, it is possible Larus could be vacationing somewhere in the southern hemisphere. We''ll see.</td>', 'It it wasn''t because it is winter time in Iceland I would bet this is a LARUS (with his famous 1.2 lens), unless it really is Larus forcing her to pretend she is not freezing. Great picture. I am not voting because I am in the race. I''d give it a 9 if I was voting (10 for her expression if I knew it is ice and snow in the background instead of ocean and waves). Of course, it is possible Larus could be vacationing somewhere in the southern hemisphere. We''ll see.', '2009-01-08 21:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181495, 752668, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the rippling patterns of the kelp.  It is not a very photogenic subject.  Focus seems a bit off as well.</td>', 'I like the rippling patterns of the kelp.  It is not a very photogenic subject.  Focus seems a bit off as well.', '2009-01-08 23:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181499, 753096, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the right hand third of this.  The blue wall and the blue boat really works well.  It is a frame within a frame. As far as the whole picture, the juxtoposition of the left half and the right half does not work for me.</td>', 'I like the right hand third of this.  The blue wall and the blue boat really works well.  It is a frame within a frame. As far as the whole picture, the juxtoposition of the left half and the right half does not work for me.', '2009-01-08 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181504, 752864, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a lot of noise.  It works well to give the effect of the barren wind swift sandy area.  Visable halos around the fence posts.</td>', 'Wow, that is a lot of noise.  It works well to give the effect of the barren wind swift sandy area.  Visable halos around the fence posts.', '2009-01-08 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181508, 753182, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the sand lines and the DPC lettering.  I am not sure the rock and especially it''s shadow adds much to the composition.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'I like the sand lines and the DPC lettering.  I am not sure the rock and especially it''s shadow adds much to the composition.  Nice lighting.', '2009-01-08 23:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181514, 752800, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like how at first glance it looks like crashing waves, then you realize it is ice and snow.  The black stick thing could have been cloned out as it is a distraction in an otherwise white area.  Great angle of the beach leading diagonally thorugh the photo.</td>', 'I like how at first glance it looks like crashing waves, then you realize it is ice and snow.  The black stick thing could have been cloned out as it is a distraction in an otherwise white area.  Great angle of the beach leading diagonally thorugh the photo.', '2009-01-08 23:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181520, 752576, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  I like contrast of the brown sand to the white backdrop.  Lighting is distracting with the many relfections.</td>', 'Nice concept.  I like contrast of the brown sand to the white backdrop.  Lighting is distracting with the many relfections.', '2009-01-08 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181521, 752930, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the "life" that the jumper gives to the image.  Nice capture of the splashes.  Nice sidelighting on the legs.  Foregound sand would look nicer with out the "footprints" or whatever those dark areas are.</td>', 'I like the "life" that the jumper gives to the image.  Nice capture of the splashes.  Nice sidelighting on the legs.  Foregound sand would look nicer with out the "footprints" or whatever those dark areas are.', '2009-01-08 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181524, 751377, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice compostition.  I like the placement of all the different elements in the frame.  Flag stick should probably be true vertical as otherwise it looks tilted.</td>', 'Nice compostition.  I like the placement of all the different elements in the frame.  Flag stick should probably be true vertical as otherwise it looks tilted.', '2009-01-08 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181526, 752610, 91496, '<td valign="top">Reds are really cool.  Is this Mars?  :)  Perhaps move the horizon a little farther from the middle of the photo to emphasize either the land or sky more.  Tire tracks kind of remove a little of the ambiance, but what can you do.</td>', 'Reds are really cool.  Is this Mars?  :)  Perhaps move the horizon a little farther from the middle of the photo to emphasize either the land or sky more.  Tire tracks kind of remove a little of the ambiance, but what can you do.', '2009-01-08 23:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181527, 752799, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the rocks and clouds, which gives it a painting like effect.  The tire tracks in the foreground are not as pretty as the rest of the scenary and detract a bit.  Perhaps a crop removing the bottom 40% would emphasis the upper part.</td>', 'I like the softness of the rocks and clouds, which gives it a painting like effect.  The tire tracks in the foreground are not as pretty as the rest of the scenary and detract a bit.  Perhaps a crop removing the bottom 40% would emphasis the upper part.', '2009-01-08 23:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181532, 752462, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the grave as it is emotional and expressive.  Deep blacks and bright whites.  I am not so fond of the upper half. There is no sense of scale -- are these caskets 20 feet away or houses 200 feet away.  I''d crop to the lower half.  I am also not a fan of the wide multi-tiered frame.  Go simple on frames.</td>', 'Love the grave as it is emotional and expressive.  Deep blacks and bright whites.  I am not so fond of the upper half. There is no sense of scale -- are these caskets 20 feet away or houses 200 feet away.  I''d crop to the lower half.  I am also not a fan of the wide multi-tiered frame.  Go simple on frames.', '2009-01-08 23:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5181598, 752231, 13688, '<td valign="top">for a moment we were all swept up together and  transported to another world.</td>', 'for a moment we were all swept up together and  transported to another world.', '2009-01-09 00:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
