(5184027, 752738, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute.  A studio shot with some fun and some pizazz.  Lighting on the stafished is great.  Crop might be a little tight to the edges.</td>', 'Cute.  A studio shot with some fun and some pizazz.  Lighting on the stafished is great.  Crop might be a little tight to the edges.', '2009-01-10 19:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
