(5184037, 752955, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition wiht the hourglass to the side.  The lighting on the top part is suberb, the lighting on the bottem is less so.  The table looks a little dusty.</td>', 'Nice composition wiht the hourglass to the side.  The lighting on the top part is suberb, the lighting on the bottem is less so.  The table looks a little dusty.', '2009-01-10 20:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5184038, 752841, 91496, '<td valign="top">It is well composed.  I like how there are foreground, middle, and background towers. Color palette is a little flat.</td>', 'It is well composed.  I like how there are foreground, middle, and background towers. Color palette is a little flat.', '2009-01-10 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5184041, 752251, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit.  I like the colors, nice and bold.  Great capture of the sand splash.  With only a single subject, I''d have preferred the sand line be closer to horizontal in the upper champer.</td>', 'Nicely lit.  I like the colors, nice and bold.  Great capture of the sand splash.  With only a single subject, I''d have preferred the sand line be closer to horizontal in the upper champer.', '2009-01-10 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5184048, 752332, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice mood provided of the desolation.  I like the lines in the sand.  Perhaps an angle where the lines were more diagonal would have created a more dynamic composition.</td>', 'Nice mood provided of the desolation.  I like the lines in the sand.  Perhaps an angle where the lines were more diagonal would have created a more dynamic composition.', '2009-01-10 20:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5184053, 753222, 91496, '<td valign="top">Sandy for sure.  I like the shadows and lighting on the hood.  Not really liking the face a lot.  The nose just looks too unnatural.  Only one of the eyes has a catchlight which sort of unbalances him.</td>', 'Sandy for sure.  I like the shadows and lighting on the hood.  Not really liking the face a lot.  The nose just looks too unnatural.  Only one of the eyes has a catchlight which sort of unbalances him.', '2009-01-10 20:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5184057, 753101, 91496, '<td valign="top">The swirls of the marbles draw in my interest, with the white one sort of balancing the color palette on the end.  The sand is well done as well, although not terriblely connected visually (albiet chemically).</td>', 'The swirls of the marbles draw in my interest, with the white one sort of balancing the color palette on the end.  The sand is well done as well, although not terriblely connected visually (albiet chemically).', '2009-01-10 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
