(5184078, 753176, 91496, '<td valign="top">Not really working for me.  Subject is odd, without really having a quirky appeal. Narrow DOF may be too narrow here.  Seems like some cloning/editing lines are also visable.</td>', 'Not really working for me.  Subject is odd, without really having a quirky appeal. Narrow DOF may be too narrow here.  Seems like some cloning/editing lines are also visable.', '2009-01-10 20:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
