(5184514, 752931, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly well done capture. I think I would like it better if you could have balanced the light a little better to eliminate the blackness in the lower left and lower right to bring in more interest in the front of the picture. The light on the bridge is excellent and I like the general feeling of calm portrayed in your picture.</td>', 'This is a fairly well done capture. I think I would like it better if you could have balanced the light a little better to eliminate the blackness in the lower left and lower right to bring in more interest in the front of the picture. The light on the bridge is excellent and I like the general feeling of calm portrayed in your picture.', '2009-01-11 07:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
