(5184517, 752693, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have certainly satisfied the challenge. I like the point of view in that you have gotten down and created a leading line but there is a lack of interest in the shot. There is nothing here to make it special. The sky is bland, the trees lack foliage, there is nothing in the water to capture the eye and nothing in the distance in which to lead the viewer. Please do not take this too critically. Just trying to help. Keep on submitting!</td>', 'You have certainly satisfied the challenge. I like the point of view in that you have gotten down and created a leading line but there is a lack of interest in the shot. There is nothing here to make it special. The sky is bland, the trees lack foliage, there is nothing in the water to capture the eye and nothing in the distance in which to lead the viewer. Please do not take this too critically. Just trying to help. Keep on submitting!', '2009-01-11 07:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
