(5184648, 752799, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but lacks sharpeness and clarity. Shooting closer to sunrise/sunset might have given you something more dramatic.</td>', 'Great subject, but lacks sharpeness and clarity. Shooting closer to sunrise/sunset might have given you something more dramatic.', '2009-01-11 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
