(5184693, 753196, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I might have clipped the very top left, but it''s a minor quibble. Nicely seen and executed.</td>', 'Beautiful. I might have clipped the very top left, but it''s a minor quibble. Nicely seen and executed.', '2009-01-11 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
