(5184779, 751306, 79720, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a wee touch oversaturated, but I like the colours and composition.</td>', 'Perhaps a wee touch oversaturated, but I like the colours and composition.', '2009-01-11 11:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
