(5185745, 753174, 15204, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF and how the background has a natural tonal gradiant from light at the top to dark at the bottom.  I wish there was a little more light on her face.  I normally don''t like cool portraits, but I think the blue tones suit the mood of this image.  Very nice.</td>', 'I love the DOF and how the background has a natural tonal gradiant from light at the top to dark at the bottom.  I wish there was a little more light on her face.  I normally don''t like cool portraits, but I think the blue tones suit the mood of this image.  Very nice.', '2009-01-11 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
