(5185757, 753130, 15204, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the contrast in this iamge.  I am not a fan of the tilt, but that is a personal preference.  The shadow on the boat is very cool.  7 from me.</td>', 'I love the colors and the contrast in this iamge.  I am not a fan of the tilt, but that is a personal preference.  The shadow on the boat is very cool.  7 from me.', '2009-01-11 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
