(5185794, 752768, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.  I sense a slight tilt to the right in the horizon. I might''ve cropped out that "y" stick on the left as it is a touch distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.  I sense a slight tilt to the right in the horizon. I might''ve cropped out that "y" stick on the left as it is a touch distracting.', '2009-01-11 23:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
