(5186268, 752201, 43088, '<td valign="top">Crystal Pier in PB.  I was up in La Jolla in the afternoon and it was nice and sunny- by the time I got back down to PB (about 4pm) the fog was getting pretty thick already.</td>', 'Crystal Pier in PB.  I was up in La Jolla in the afternoon and it was nice and sunny- by the time I got back down to PB (about 4pm) the fog was getting pretty thick already.', '2009-01-12 04:10:02.000000', NULL, 0),
