(5186407, 752970, 42601, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> What kind of poodle is that??! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s not a poodle. It''s a Rhodesian Ridgeback.<br/> <br/>By saying "Sand is for poodles" I was hinting that the Rhodesian Ridgeback is leaving the sand for the water - implying that sand is for wussies/whimps/smaller dogs and that water is for the big dogs (like the one in the photo that is clearly not a poodle).<br/> <br/>I guess it went over your head a little.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: What kind of poodle is that??!   It''s not a poodle. It''s a Rhodesian Ridgeback. By saying "Sand is for poodles" I was hinting that the Rhodesian Ridgeback is leaving the sand for the water - implying that sand is for wussies/whimps/smaller dogs and that water is for the big dogs (like the one in the photo that is clearly not a poodle). I guess it went over your head a little.', '2009-01-12 07:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186414, 753026, 76335, '<td valign="top">Your kitchen. Ha! So much for my longing to be where this was taken. Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Your kitchen. Ha! So much for my longing to be where this was taken. Congrats on the top 10.', '2009-01-12 07:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186415, 752871, 69246, '<td valign="top">This was my #1, but good to see where you placed. Nice shot!</td>', 'This was my #1, but good to see where you placed. Nice shot!', '2009-01-12 07:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186418, 753064, 55005, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Lev!</td>', 'Congrats, Lev!', '2009-01-12 07:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186420, 752864, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BrianR:</b></div><hr/><i> And I would have been more impressed had you cropped out the power lines, excellent work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And I would have been <i>much less</i> impressed had he cropped out the power lines. This was the only ten I handed out and is my pick of this challenge. It took some guts to enter this -- power lines, lack of sand and all.</td>', 'Originally posted by BrianR: And I would have been more impressed had you cropped out the power lines, excellent work.   And I would have been much less impressed had he cropped out the power lines. This was the only ten I handed out and is my pick of this challenge. It took some guts to enter this -- power lines, lack of sand and all.', '2009-01-12 07:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186428, 753132, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Lensbaby? If so, the sweet spot could be sweeter. Still wonderfully abstract and very nice... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I commented honestly but gave it a seven anyway. I like that it has an almost cosmic feel to it. Sorry it didn''t do better for you.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Lensbaby? If so, the sweet spot could be sweeter. Still wonderfully abstract and very nice...   I commented honestly but gave it a seven anyway. I like that it has an almost cosmic feel to it. Sorry it didn''t do better for you.', '2009-01-12 07:35:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186443, 753064, 99218, '<td valign="top">Amazing!Fabulous shot !</td>', 'Amazing!Fabulous shot !', '2009-01-12 07:57:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186444, 753099, 99218, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot !</td>', 'Fabulous shot !', '2009-01-12 07:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186448, 753064, 32767, '<td valign="top">You da man!</td>', 'You da man!', '2009-01-12 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186460, 752768, 50695, '<td valign="top">apocalyptic sky: 4<br/>doggies: 4<br/> <br/>total: 8</td>', 'apocalyptic sky: 4doggies: 4 total: 8', '2009-01-12 08:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186461, 752096, 50695, '<td valign="top">Dang, I think you were unfairly punished because of a general Wizard of Oz ignorance at DPC.</td>', 'Dang, I think you were unfairly punished because of a general Wizard of Oz ignorance at DPC.', '2009-01-12 08:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186463, 752887, 50695, '<td valign="top">I only gave you a 6, but I was in a bad mood. I also gave <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a>, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=13688" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">muur88</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=21714" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">xion</a> a 6 in this challenge. My average vote was probably around 4. I''m experimenting with using the full 1 to 10 scale. But enough about me. What do I think about your picture? It''s actually quite good. It has a lot of energy, which I feel from the texture and the composition. The horsie is a work of Modern Art, as is your entire picture. You have a knack for integrating art into a photograph, which then becomes another work of art. Vicious Cycle!</td>', 'I only gave you a 6, but I was in a bad mood. I also gave  pointandshoot,  muur88 and  xion a 6 in this challenge. My average vote was probably around 4. I''m experimenting with using the full 1 to 10 scale. But enough about me. What do I think about your picture? It''s actually quite good. It has a lot of energy, which I feel from the texture and the composition. The horsie is a work of Modern Art, as is your entire picture. You have a knack for integrating art into a photograph, which then becomes another work of art. Vicious Cycle!', '2009-01-12 08:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186478, 752269, 54228, '<td valign="top">YOU WIN! Best photo of the year and it''s only January! I love this, so much emotion and wonder. Should have won!</td>', 'YOU WIN! Best photo of the year and it''s only January! I love this, so much emotion and wonder. Should have won!', '2009-01-12 08:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186518, 752677, 75386, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiberius:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the out of the box approach and the stop motion. With no influence to the score I strongly dislike the frame. Good luck </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree 100% about both comments.  This is a great photo!</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiberius: I like the out of the box approach and the stop motion. With no influence to the score I strongly dislike the frame. Good luck   I agree 100% about both comments.  This is a great photo!', '2009-01-12 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186549, 753064, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, and thanks for sharing your journey as well as your processing.</td>', 'Congratulations, and thanks for sharing your journey as well as your processing.', '2009-01-12 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186553, 752871, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Mark.  This "should have" ribboned, but 4th ain''t bad!</td>', 'Congrats, Mark.  This "should have" ribboned, but 4th ain''t bad!', '2009-01-12 09:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186558, 752201, 61961, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> two san diegans on the front page, that''s nice! :) Congrats, lovely shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Get it?  Sand-iego?  (sorry).  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: two san diegans on the front page, that''s nice! :) Congrats, lovely shot!  Get it?  Sand-iego?  (sorry).  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.', '2009-01-12 09:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186563, 752231, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love this image, I cannot believe how underrated it was in this challenge. Beautiful image.</td>', 'I love this image, I cannot believe how underrated it was in this challenge. Beautiful image.', '2009-01-12 09:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186566, 752677, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m such an ass and really glad Ubique is here to point that out. ;)<br/> <br/>I was more wrapped up in knowing where this was taken (Coney or the Rockaways) to even notice the pairings. I need to get my head out of my butt and start looking a little more.<br/> <br/>Really, really nice. Cheers and congrats on your well earned Thumb.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-13 11:00:01.</i></td>', 'I''m such an ass and really glad Ubique is here to point that out. ;) I was more wrapped up in knowing where this was taken (Coney or the Rockaways) to even notice the pairings. I need to get my head out of my butt and start looking a little more. Really, really nice. Cheers and congrats on your well earned Thumb.', '2009-01-12 09:07:07.000000', '2009-01-13 11:00:01.000000', 0),
(5186581, 753064, 30982, '<td valign="top">You needed to rake the sand first... :-)  Congrats on the ribbon, and being exceptionally well prepared to get the shot you wanted, and getting that shot then working it to the way you wanted it, and being probably the most well-traveled member of DPC.  Oh, and those are some seriously sensual striations.  I''d probably have more fun just looking at the rocks than shooting them.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-12 09:20:01.</i></td>', 'You needed to rake the sand first... :-)  Congrats on the ribbon, and being exceptionally well prepared to get the shot you wanted, and getting that shot then working it to the way you wanted it, and being probably the most well-traveled member of DPC.  Oh, and those are some seriously sensual striations.  I''d probably have more fun just looking at the rocks than shooting them.', '2009-01-12 09:18:19.000000', '2009-01-12 09:20:01.000000', 0),
(5186586, 753064, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Lev!  Great exposure and colors.  Congratulations on the blue!</td>', 'Beautiful Lev!  Great exposure and colors.  Congratulations on the blue!', '2009-01-12 09:21:13.000000', NULL, 0),
