(5188999, 752677, 32767, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Matt -  Have you considered that he may be hiring actors to <i>stage</i> these elaborately improbable street tableaux that you photograph, without your actually being aware of it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, I hired DeSoussa. Flew him in from Lisbon just for the job. No way I could have pulled that scene off without the help of a master.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt;&lt;Pawdrix returns head to butt&gt;&gt;&gt;</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Matt -  Have you considered that he may be hiring actors to stage these elaborately improbable street tableaux that you photograph, without your actually being aware of it?   Actually, I hired DeSoussa. Flew him in from Lisbon just for the job. No way I could have pulled that scene off without the help of a master. <<<Pawdrix returns head to butt>>>', '2009-01-13 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
