(5189029, 753064, 43156, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Great photo and great finish!<br/>There is nothing to be embarrassed of. Just like my signature says: "The art of photography mostly consists of being in the right place at the right time having the right equipment and the right attitude" and you have all these!<br/></td>', 'Congratulations! Great photo and great finish!There is nothing to be embarrassed of. Just like my signature says: "The art of photography mostly consists of being in the right place at the right time having the right equipment and the right attitude" and you have all these!', '2009-01-13 11:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
