(5189535, 753064, 8125, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  If you ever get back there again, you CAN go directly to the Indians and pay to get in; they let you stay 4 hours.  The tour companies would like you to think that it''s not possible to go without them.  :-)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the very well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  If you ever get back there again, you CAN go directly to the Indians and pay to get in; they let you stay 4 hours.  The tour companies would like you to think that it''s not possible to go without them.  :-) Congrats on the very well deserved ribbon.', '2009-01-13 18:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
