(5197227, 753026, 86447, '<td valign="top">Have you begun sharpening more than you used to, Irene?   It seems that lately my inner comment is "seems oversharpened" on your images before I even know they''re yours.<br/> <br/>I know I''m a nobody and you''re a great photographer... no really, you are... but still... I say it... and I thought you''d want to know.</td>', 'Have you begun sharpening more than you used to, Irene?   It seems that lately my inner comment is "seems oversharpened" on your images before I even know they''re yours. I know I''m a nobody and you''re a great photographer... no really, you are... but still... I say it... and I thought you''d want to know.', '2009-01-16 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
